        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Piece showing nymph beside altar inscribed \"L'Amitié ne'craint du Temps\", below Time being rowed by Cupid, and Time rowing a sleeping Cupid, printed in red from engraved copper-plate, or roller.  Rust stains and nail holes along side and lower edge."@en ;
